  "document": "Merv\nMerv (Turkmen: Merw , \"Мерв\", مرو; Persian: مرو‎ ‎ , \"Marv\"), formerly Achaemenid Satrapy of Margiana, and later Alexandria (Margiana) (Ἀλεξάνδρεια) and Antiochia in Margiana (Greek: Ἀντιόχεια τῆς Μαργιανῆς ), was a major oasis-city in Central Asia, on the historical Silk Road, located near today's Mary in Turkmenistan."
